#  AUMRTI — LOCAL ENV & SUPABASE CREDENTIALS  (SINGLE SECRETS FILE)
#
#  ⚠️  GITIGNORED (matched by `*.local` in /.gitignore) and now UNTRACKED.
#      NEVER commit this file. NEVER paste it into chat / logs / screenshots.
#      Verify it's ignored:  git check-ignore -v .env.local
#
#  ⚠️  VITE_ = PUBLIC. Any var named VITE_* is bundled into the browser JS and
#      visible to every user. So ONLY the URL + anon key carry VITE_.
#      Secrets (DB password, service_role) use plain names — Vite never ships them.
#
#  ⚠️  The Supabase personal ACCESS TOKEN is NOT stored here. It lives in the
#      `supabase login` keychain (~/.supabase). See supabase/MIGRATION_RUNBOOK.md.
#
#  WHO READS WHAT:
#    • App (Vite)      → VITE_SUPABASE_URL + VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY (below).
#    • Supabase CLI    → `supabase login` token + SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD (load per session).
#    • Edge functions  → Deno.env, set via `supabase secrets set` (NOT this file).
###############################################################################


